Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:03.50,Default,Mark,0,0,0,,Morning, Lena. You're early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.60,0:00:06.20,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,{\i1}Couldn't sleep. The rain kept me up all night.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:10.80,Default,Mark,0,0,0,,Did you finish the report for the captain?\NShe was asking about it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.90,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.90,0:00:15.40,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,I just need to check the numbers again.
Comment: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.50,Default,note,0,0,0,,check timing of this scene later
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:19.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,80)}CITY POLICE DEPARTMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:24.00,Default,Mark,0,0,0,,If the numbers don't add up, we'll have to go back to the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:27.00,Default,Lena,0,0,0,,Wait. Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:32.00,Default,Mark,0,0,0,,Probably just the wind.
